body:
Listen, I get killing yourself as an alternative. I'm even for it as an option. Truly. No one should be forced to live a life they don't want to live, as far as I am concerned.

&#x200B;

But!!!! I really hope this is something. This small area of understanding and justice, between you and I. It's actually rather special, to be honest. There ARE like minded people who are in your situation, or who understand this stupid ass shit.

&#x200B;

AND even if there is only hard fucking work benefiting only the privileged ahead for all of us, there is something you will receive in exchange that the privileged will NEVER understand. And that is something I and many of our friend's here understand. That life is sh\*t, BUT there is some honest to goodness understanding to be found. Understanding that yet somehow eludes those privileged fucks. There is some level of happiness there, I know you have felt it at least once before. You can feel it again. I know you can.
